// Core-issued DMA packets using the probability/value binding tables.
// Each table slot holds a 64-bit device base installed by cohort preparation.
// The byte-offset argument is added with carry. Geometry, address, and queue
// writes retain the channel's publication order; caller-side locks retire each
// transfer before its local or peer storage can be reused.
target.decl @qwen3_embedding.panels.core

